#, fuzzy
msgid "JLink packaging"
msgstr "JLink 封装"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `jlink` extension produces a custom Java runtime image for a Quarkus application.\n"
"The image contains only the JDK modules and application modules that are needed to run the application, resulting in a smaller, faster, and more self-contained distribution.\n"
"This extension depends on the xref:modularity.adoc[Quarkus modularity extension] to compute the application's module graph."
msgstr "`jlink` 扩展会为 Quarkus 应用程序生成一个自定义的 Java 运行时映像。该映像仅包含运行应用程序所需的 JDK 模块和应用程序模块，从而生成一个体积更小、运行更快且更自包含的发行版。该扩展依赖于 xref:modularity.adoc[Quarkus 模块化扩展] 来计算应用程序的模块图。"

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "这项技术被认为是{extension-status}。"

msgid ""
"In _experimental_ mode, early feedback is requested to mature the idea.\n"
"There is no guarantee of stability nor long term presence in the platform until the solution matures.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr "在 _experimental(实验)_ 模式下，要求早期反馈以使想法成熟。在解决方案成熟之前，不保证稳定性或长期存在于平台中。欢迎在我们的 link:https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[邮件列表] 中提供反馈，或在我们的 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub问题列表] 中提出问题。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "如需查看所有可能状态的完整列表，请参阅我们的 link:https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[常见问题解答] 。"

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `jlink` extension requires Java 25 or later.\n"
"Earlier JDK versions have compatibility issues with the `jlink` tool that prevent reliable image generation."
msgstr "`jlink` 扩展需要 Java 25 或更高版本。较早版本的 JDK 与 `jlink` 工具存在兼容性问题，导致无法可靠地生成镜像。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Add the `quarkus-jlink` extension to your project.\n"
"When the extension is present, a `jlink` image is produced automatically as part of the normal Quarkus build.\n"
"JAR packaging is disabled when `jlink` is active."
msgstr "将 `quarkus-jlink` 扩展添加到您的项目中。安装该扩展后，系统会在常规 Quarkus 构建过程中自动生成一个 `jlink` 映像。当 `jlink` 处于活动状态时，JAR 打包功能将被禁用。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "After adding the extension, build the project normally:"
msgstr "添加扩展后，按常规流程构建项目："

#, fuzzy
msgid "The `jlink` image is written to the output directory (by default, `target/jlink-output/image`)."
msgstr "`jlink` 映像文件将写入输出目录（默认位于 `target/jlink-output/image` ）。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Running the image"
msgstr "运行镜像"

#, fuzzy
msgid "To run the application, execute the launcher script in the image's `bin` directory:"
msgstr "要运行该应用程序，请执行镜像中 `bin` 目录下的启动脚本："

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The launcher name currently defaults to `my-app`.\n"
"A future release will derive the default from `quarkus.package.output-name`."
msgstr "启动器的名称目前默认为 `my-app` 。在未来的版本中，默认名称将根据 `quarkus.package.output-name` 确定。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Image layout"
msgstr "图片布局"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The output directory has the standard `jlink` image structure.\n"
"The `bin/` directory contains the launcher script.\n"
"The `lib/` directory contains the JDK runtime modules.\n"
"Application modules that are not on the boot module path are placed in `lib/quarkus/` and are loaded dynamically on demand after startup by `smallrye-modules`.\n"
"See the xref:modularity.adoc[modularity guide] for an explanation of boot modules and dynamic modules."
msgstr "输出目录采用标准的 `jlink` 映像结构。 `bin/` 目录中包含启动脚本。 `lib/` 目录包含 JDK 运行时模块。未位于启动模块路径中的应用程序模块会被放置在 `lib/quarkus/ 中` ，并在启动后由 `smallrye-modules` 根据需求动态加载。有关启动模块和动态模块的说明，请参阅 xref:modularity.adoc[模块化指南] 。"

